    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_a1825063",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: latinos_for_me_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme uses a distorted image of Donald Trump shouting with the text 'latinos for me!' juxtaposed with 'that's like roaches for raid!' to create a hateful and degrading analogy. The intent is to equate Latinos with pests (roaches) that should be eradicated, invoking a racist and xenophobic stereotype. This is a direct attack on a specific ethnic group, using inflammatory and derogatory language to promote prejudice and hostility. The meme is designed to incite hatred and reinforce harmful anti-Latino stereotypes, particularly those associating Latinos with criminality, uncleanliness, or being a burden on society, which falls under the category of hateful content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_7d5f3327"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
