      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "raids",
      "label": "Raids",
      "description": "Raids refer to sudden, often violent, military or law enforcement operations to seize or destroy something, typically used in the context of immigration enforcement or drug operations. In the meme, 'raids' is used as a euphemism for violent extermination, reinforcing the dehumanizing metaphor of Latinos as pests to be eradicated.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
